.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK RELEASE BULK MEMBERSHIP"
.SH NAME
hamstik release bulk-membership \- Change release memberships for up to 50 Work Items from a JSON file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik release bulk-membership [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Change release memberships for up to 50 Work Items from a JSON file
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --file
JSON file containing `{ "operations": [...] }` (`-` for stdin)
.TP
.B --project
Project key (overrides context)
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
